    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864400/extras/19249bd484e2aba89c33819fe32c101c.webp?t=1711018815\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br><br><u><strong>Simple Controls, Endless Joy:</strong></u><br>Navigate a busy city, a dense forest, and a disturbed pond with a single action\u2013 <strong>UP</strong>. Whether you're a daring monkey, a soaring owl, or a leaping frog, the controls are effortlessly simple, promising endless joy for players of all ages.<br><u>Keyboard/Mouse: <i>'W', 'UP Arrow Key', 'Space Bar', 'Left Mouse Button'</i></u><br><br><u><strong>Three Unique Levels:</strong></u><br>Explore distinct levels, each presenting unique challenges and introducing new gameplay mechanics. From the hustle of city life to the tranquility of the forest, every level is crafted as a pixelated playground, ensuring a fresh and engaging experience.<br><br><u><strong>Play, Jump, and Soar:</strong></u><br>Immerse yourself in a visually enchanting 2D pixelated world. The charming graphics create a family-friendly atmosphere, transforming 'Up &amp; Down' into a delightful experience filled with whimsy and wonder.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864400/extras/19249bd484e2aba89c33819fe32c101c.webp?t=1711018815\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br><br><u><strong>Simple Controls, Endless Joy:</strong></u><br>Navigate a busy city, a dense forest, and a disturbed pond with a single action\u2013 <strong>UP</strong>. Whether you're a daring monkey, a soaring owl, or a leaping frog, the controls are effortlessly simple, promising endless joy for players of all ages.<br><u>Keyboard/Mouse: <i>'W', 'UP Arrow Key', 'Space Bar', 'Left Mouse Button'</i></u><br><br><u><strong>Three Unique Levels:</strong></u><br>Explore distinct levels, each presenting unique challenges and introducing new gameplay mechanics. From the hustle of city life to the tranquility of the forest, every level is crafted as a pixelated playground, ensuring a fresh and engaging experience.<br><br><u><strong>Play, Jump, and Soar:</strong></u><br>Immerse yourself in a visually enchanting 2D pixelated world. The charming graphics create a family-friendly atmosphere, transforming 'Up &amp; Down' into a delightful experience filled with whimsy and wonder.",
